						],
						"pointId": 5536
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2904.566,
							441.616,
							4182.956
						],
						"pointId": 5746
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741210701,
					"content": "...What? So they didn't intend to kill me at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210702,
					"content": "*sigh* You guys are really observant. That's right. I was the one who broke the machine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210703,
					"content": "But why did you break the machine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210704,
					"content": "Hmph, why indeed! Because...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210705,
					"content": "A long time ago, I lived a poor and miserable life. I was really depressed. Then, I met a guy who gave me a healthy drink that lifted my spirits.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210706,
					"content": "He was really kind to me. So I wanted to pay him back for his kindness. One day, I had my chance. He introduced me to some very rich people and asked me to help them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210707,
					"content": "All I did was menial work, such as collecting mechanical parts that belonged to the Fontaine Research Institute. The rich people paid me a pretty sum for those chores.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210708,
					"content": "Whoa, sounds pretty awesome.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210709,
					"content": "Right? This time, they asked me to find this strange machine, take the core out, and deliver the core to them. I can both repay my bro and make some money. I've gotta give my all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210710,
					"content": "But, those terrible people... Perhaps they hated seeing me working hard to change my life for the better. They interfered with my work and warned me against delivering the— umm, precision components to my employers!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210711,
					"content": "But I wouldn't let them win! I took the job, and protested against their behavior!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210712,
					"content": "And as a result, like you said, I was taught a lesson...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210713,
					"content": "Oh... Poor you... But is this job of yours really so well-paid?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210714,
					"content": "Of course. This is one of the reasons why I didn't want to tell you why I'm protesting. However, since you saved my life...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210715,
					"content": "Not as much as saving your life, I mean...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210716,
					"content": "...I also thought that since you two are really observant, I might as well just tell you the truth. You can see it as a collaboration.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210717,
					"content": "Such strange machines have been deployed above ground and underwater. It's easy to spot such machines — they all produce a peculiar light around them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210718,
					"content": "Handle it for me and bring me the specific core inside it. There should be <color=#00E1FFFF>seven</color> in total. After it's done, we'll split the earnings fifty-fifty. Deal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210719,
						741210721,
						741210722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210719,
					"content": "Sounds good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210720
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210720,
					"content": "Hmmm, but what do these machines do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210725,
					"content": "They destroy the environment. These machines are evil stuff.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210726,
					"content": "Destroy how?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210727,
					"content": "How am I going to know? I'm not a member of the Fontaine Research Institute. Anomalies have already occurred, so it has to be hazardous to the environment!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210728,
					"content": "Well... That sounds reasonable. Every time we see any supernatural environment during our adventure, there's bound to be some trouble that we have to deal with...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210729,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, why don't we help Henri?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210730,
					"content": "Haha, great! It's settled then! <color=#00E1FFFF>Bring me seven cores</color>, let's become rich together!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210721,
					"content": "What do these machines do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210725
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210722,
					"content": "I take 70% of the earnings and 20% must be paid in advance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210723
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210723,
					"content": "Ugh, fine. But I really can't give it to you in advance. I'm still waiting for everything to be done so that I can get paid!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Henri"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210724,
					"content": "Hmmm, but what do these machines do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
